  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At a banquet in shark sea, Shark Demon lists Eastern Sea sea areas ranked above his own and names her among their owners.",
      "chapters": [
        892
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shark_demon",
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is the only descendant left of Song Qi Yuan’s bloodline. Her father Song Diao Ling was a rank seven Gu Immortal, publicly recognized as successor, until he was schemed against and died over ten years before this stretch. From a young age her grandfather pampered her and supplied her cultivation resources. When she underwent immortal ascension, he personally protected her. After she advanced to rank six, he gave her the poetic emotion sea area, four million square kilometers, ranked above Shark Demon’s shark sea.",
      "chapters": [
        893
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "clan-granddaughter",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_song_qi_yuan",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan, as Xing Xiang Zi, appears while she is bathing in the hot spring of an underwater volcano. During the chase that follows, speakers call her Fairy Yi Shi.",
      "chapters": [
        895
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "underwater-volcano",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She charges into the study room in Heavy Water blessed land and throws a tantrum to Song Qi Yuan, asking him to avenge her. She is called a young female Gu Immortal. He gives her a token and sends her to twin polar sea strait to find Song Jia Dan.",
      "chapters": [
        899
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "study-room",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_heavy_water_blessed_land",
        "char_song_jia_dan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the Song clan camp at Ascending Heaven Plain she is a young woman dressed in white, seemingly glowing with snow-white light, pure as jade. The same stretch calls her the prized jewel of Song clan and one of the beauties of Eastern Sea.",
      "chapters": [
        986
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_song_clan",
        "loc_ascending_heaven_plain"
      ]
    }
  ],
